  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifqs-QualityObjective">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifqs:QualityObjective</rdfs:label>
    <mz:addedOn>2026-11-17</mz:addedOn>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Unaligned"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0021-ifqs FR-032</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>Examined: ISO 9001 clause 6.2 (quality objectives) and OpenTelemetry's metric data model (a measure, no target); neither publishes an IRI for an objective with a target and an error budget. OpenSLO is a community specification and not a consensus standard (to verify). Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005).</mz:justification>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifqs#QualityObjective</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifqs-QualityTier">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifqs:QualityTier</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0021-ifqs FR-036</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:mappingRelation>subClassOf</mz:mappingRelation>
    <mz:standardTerm>http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept</mz:standardTerm>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifqs#QualityTier</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifqs-ReviewDebt">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifqs:ReviewDebt</rdfs:label>
    <mz:addedOn>2026-11-17</mz:addedOn>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Unaligned"/>
    <mz:definedBy>0021-ifqs FR-023</mz:definedBy>
    <mz:justification>Examined: ISO/IEC 25010 (quality characteristics of a product, not of the evidence for them); no standard names a count of requirements held below a proof grade. Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005).</mz:justification>
    <mz:termIri>https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifqs#ReviewDebt</mz:termIri>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/id/mizan/term-ifqs-TestCase">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#OntologyTerm"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ifqs:TestCase</rdfs:label>
    <mz:basis rdf:resource="https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/mizan#Specializes"/>
